msgid "Do you really want to clear the all time statistical data?"
msgstr "Anda pasti mahu kosongkan semua data statistikal?"

#: lskat.cpp:458
msgid "Game ended...start a new one..."
msgstr "Permainan tamat...mulakan yang baru..."

